AskSherlock 

AskSherlock is an AI-powered book recommendation system built using Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG).

Features
- Semantic book search
- Vector similarity using FAISS
- Embeddings using SentenceTransformers
- Streamlit web interface

Tech Stack
- Python
- SentenceTransformers
- FAISS
- Pandas
- Streamlit

Example Queries
- dark fantasy magic
- romantic historical fiction
- space sci-fi adventure

How to Run

pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py